 <body data-template-id="__page-root" class="w-full" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(250, 247, 248), rgb(250, 247, 248)) !important; background-clip: border-box !important; background-size: 100vw 100vh !important; display: flow-root;">
  <header data-template-id="cover-section" class="canva-header w-full bg-[#f5edf9]" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgb(245, 237, 249), rgb(245, 237, 249)) !important; background-clip: border-box !important;">
   <div class="page-width py-7 md:py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[#d9c9df] pb-4">
     <p data-template-id="course-tag" class="canva-tag eyebrow text-[#61249a]" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important; --canva-color: #61249aff; caret-color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">MS ENTREPRENEURSHIP · THURSDAY, OCTOBER 22, 2026</p>
     <p data-template-id="course-motto" class="canva-text eyebrow text-[#cc2474]" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(204, 36, 116) !important; --canva-color: #cc2474ff; caret-color: rgb(204, 36, 116) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">ASK · LISTEN · DECIDE</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_.95fr] items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 pt-8">
     <div>
      <p data-template-id="hero-kicker" class="canva-tag eyebrow text-[#cc2474] mb-4" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(204, 36, 116) !important; --canva-color: #cc2474ff; caret-color: rgb(204, 36, 116) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">A 60-MINUTE FIELD LAB</p>
      <h1 data-template-id="hero-title" class="canva-text display font-bold leading-[1.08] text-[#241c30] mb-3" data-canva-font-size="3rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; --canva-color: #241c30ff; caret-color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 42px;">Assumption to Evidence</h1>
      <p data-template-id="hero-subtitle" class="canva-text font-bold text-[#61249a] mb-5" data-canva-font-size="1.375rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important; --canva-color: #61249aff; caret-color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1.375rem !important;">Customer Interview Lab</p>
      <p data-template-id="hero-description" class="canva-text leading-relaxed text-[#51495a] max-w-lg" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(81, 73, 90) !important; --canva-color: #51495aff; caret-color: rgb(81, 73, 90) !important;  font-weight: 400 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Study a real customer problem, interview three classmates about a school routine, and decide what the evidence suggests you should do next.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 mt-7 pt-4 border-t border-[#d9c9df]"><span data-template-id="date-chip" class="canva-tag font-bold text-[#61249a]" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important; --canva-color: #61249aff; caret-color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">Thursday, October 22, 2026</span> <span data-template-id="time-chip" class="canva-tag font-bold text-[#61249a]" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important; --canva-color: #61249aff; caret-color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">60 minutes</span> <span data-template-id="product-chip" class="canva-tag font-bold text-[#61249a]" data-canva-font-size="1rem" style="white-space: pre-wrap !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important; --canva-color: #61249aff; caret-color: rgb(97, 36, 154) !important;  font-weight: 700 !important; font-style: normal !important; font-size: 1rem !important;">3 interviews + evidence decision</span>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div data-template-id="hero-graphic" class="canva-card hero-graphic w-full shadow-lg shadow-purple-900/10" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of classmates gathering evidence about a customer problem" style="background-image: linear-gradient(145deg, rgb(255, 247, 252), rgb(234, 216, 244)) !important; background-clip: border-box !important; color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important; --canva-color: #241c30ff; caret-color: rgb(36, 28, 48) !important;">
      <div class="hero-graphic-art" aria-hidden="true">
       <div class="hero-graphic-card"></div>
       <div class="hero-graphic-people"><span class="hero-graphic-person"></span><span class="hero-graphic-person"></span><span class="hero-graphic-person"></span>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
   </div>
  </header>
  <nav aria-label="Assignment sections" class="no-print w-full border-y border-[#e9e1e8] bg-white">
